// Sea names (this game's own rules, docs/NAVAL.md, 4.1): when the map is made each sea draws a
//     name without repeats, through the map RNG, from the lists without `lake`; a water area that
//     is one sea and touches no map edge draws from the lists with `lake` (then from the others).
//     When the names run out: "Sea N". Invented names, none of a real place or of the setting's
